          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus got into a boat, and his disciples went with him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suddenly a fierce storm hit the lake, and the boat was in danger of sinking. But Jesus was asleep. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The disciples went to him and woke him up. “Save us, Lord!” they said. “We are about to die!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
