            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The men who had been taking care of the pigs ran away and went into the town, where they told the whole story and what had happened to the men with the demons. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So everyone from the town went out to meet Jesus; and when they saw him, they begged him to leave their territory.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.34"
            ]
          }
        }
